    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d150">

                <pb facs="0273" n="157" xml:id="pg157"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 793.94/371.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Chargé Wheeler.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-24T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1915—5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The note to China to which you refer is identic with the one telegraphed you May
                    11, 5 p.m., and which you communicated to the Foreign Office May 13. Department
                    does not understand why this note should cause criticism.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
